printf "expected timeout flow: mode=2 starts ACTIVE; after 10 s state=2 and joystick wake allowed=0; A/B/L/R shows one bounded cue then returns to page 6 and STOP2; START returns state=1, runs one three-frame activation, and restores joystick wake\n"
printf "--- end package interaction lifecycle ---\n"
